hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19228","Sufyan ibn Uyaynah narrated to us, Zakariyya narrated to us from al-Shabi from al-Harith ibn Malik Ibn Barsaa from the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) who said: Makkah will not be raided after this ever. Sufyan said: Al-Harith is Khuzai."
"19229","Yazid ibn Harun narrated to us, he said: Zakariyya informed us from Amir from al-Harith ibn Malik Ibn Barsaa who said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say on the Day of the Conquest of Makkah: This will not be raided after this ever until the Day of Resurrection."
